From 38a218e0d03f8ea14c010d8f146f69d93730f907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tsetsen-erdene Ganbaatar <dis446@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:07:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): live provider credit chip for API-key balances

Show the active provider's remaining credit at the right edge of the
status line, polled once a minute from the provider's own balance
endpoint (DeepSeek and Moonshot). Providers without a balance API render
nothing, failures render nothing instead of a fabricated zero, and
[display] provider_balance = false turns the chip off.
